@inherits LayoutComponentBase
@inject ModuleBridge Bridge

@* The shell is deliberately thin: the ported Tracks UI brings its own full-height layout. The theme
   is *not* repeated here — the bridge writes it onto the document element, and a second copy on this
   wrapper went stale (it kept the "light" default), which made the tour tooltip render white-on-white
   in the core's dark theme. The bridge is still injected so the layout re-renders when it changes. *@
<div class="tracks-root">
    @Body
</div>
